---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Webcam Platforms We Work With"
  description="EWO provides promotion and marketing services for models and studios across all major live streaming platforms. Learn which platforms we support and how we approach each one."
>
  <article>
    <h1>Platforms We Work With</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      We help models and studios grow on all major adult live streaming platforms.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Platform Approach</h2>
    <p>
      Each cam platform has its own algorithm, audience demographics, payout structure, and
      content culture. Effective promotion requires understanding these differences — what works
      on one platform may be irrelevant or counterproductive on another.
    </p>
    <p>
      We don't use a one-size-fits-all approach. Our strategies are platform-specific, built around
      how each platform's discovery, ranking, and engagement systems actually work.
    </p>

    <h2>Platform Categories We Cover</h2>

    <h3>Token-Based Live Streaming Platforms</h3>
    <p>
      The most common cam platform model. Viewers purchase tokens and spend them on tips and
      private shows. We optimize for discovery algorithms, token tip frequency, and private show
      conversion rates on all major platforms in this category.
    </p>

    <h3>Subscription-First Platforms</h3>
    <p>
      Some platforms prioritize fan subscriptions over per-show tips. The growth strategy here
      focuses on converting first-time viewers to subscribers — a fundamentally different funnel
      than tip-based platforms.
    </p>

    <h3>Multi-Platform Strategy</h3>
    <p>
      Many of our most successful clients stream on multiple platforms simultaneously or sequentially.
      We help design multi-platform strategies that maximize aggregate income without burning out —
      including which platforms to prioritize at different career stages.
    </p>

    <h2>Geographic Platform Differences</h2>
    <p>
      Platform market share varies significantly by region. Some platforms dominate in North America
      while having minimal presence in Eastern Europe, and vice versa. Our geo-specific strategies
      factor in which platforms actually have audiences in your target market.
    </p>

    <h2>A Note on Platform Names</h2>
    <p>
      We work across all major platforms in the industry. We don't prominently feature platform
      brand names in our marketing — the platforms we support are well-known to anyone in the
      industry, and our strategies are designed around how each platform works, not its name.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions About a Specific Platform?</h2>
    <p>
      Contact us and specify which platform you're working with. We'll tell you exactly what
      we can do for your situation.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/model-promotion">See our model promotion services →</a></p>
    <p><a href="/studio-traffic">See our studio services →</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>
